1. Production editor UI uses the repository-pinned upstream Dear ImGui API plus MGIF-owned app, scene, renderer, and RHI adapters only.
2. Production has zero direct, public, wrapper, re-export, include, link, target, generated-source, or transitive dependency on `nvcore`, any `nvpro*`, `nvapp`, `nvgui`, any `nvvk*`, `nvvkgltf`, `vk_gltf_renderer`, or any reference Vulkan helper/framework. Neutral renaming is not an exception.
